<span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">var</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中序贯临界值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z^*_{\\alpha/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1857em;vertical-align:-0.497em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.378em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.497em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 严格大于固定样本下的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.96</span></span></span></span></span>，多出来的宽度就是为反复窥探付出的代价，它随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 收敛而收窄。读法很简单：<strong>只要修正后的区间仍包含 0 就不能下结论</strong>，只有排除 0 时序贯显著才站得住。Statsig 另提醒：某指标早期显著<strong>不代表其他指标已有足够检验力</strong>，早期停止只应围绕少数决策指标，且正当理由通常只有一类——<strong>检测到严重负向回归</strong>（如结算错误率飙升），此时目标是止损而非定论（同来源）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境合规与运营治理-实验与分层的边界\">跨境合规与运营治理：实验与分层的边界</h2><p>分层定价与自动化升降级在不同司法辖区撞上不同规则，配置治理必须把这些规则编码成发布前的校验项，而非留给事后合规审查。三类约束值得内置进上面那张流程图的 C 阶段。</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>自动化决策的透明性</strong>。当系统仅凭算法对用户做出有重大影响的决定（自动降级、取消专享权益），GDPR 第 22 条对这类&quot;完全自动化决策&quot;设有专门约束，包括知情权、获得人工干预的权利、以及对决定表达异议的权利（GDPR Art. 22）。工程含义是：降级决定必须保留人工复核入口与解释字段，不能只写一个布尔结果落库。其二是<strong>地域定价的边界</strong>。欧盟《地理封锁条例》（Regulation (EU) 2018/302）禁止无正当理由地基于客户国籍或居住地对同一商品服务施加不同条件，因此分层规则应按<strong>用户身份（会员等级）<strong>而非</strong>地理位置</strong>建模——前者是合法的差异化服务，后者是被禁止的无理由差别待遇。其三是<strong>审计与保密</strong>。配置一旦能改会员价、返券面额，就落进财务与访问控制审计范围：变更日志要可追溯，未公开的定价策略要加密存储。AppConfig 把这三条分别落在 <code>CloudTrail</code>（审计）、<code>IAM</code>（访问控制）、<code>KMS</code>（加密）上（来源：<a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/appconfig/latest/userguide/what-is-appconfig.html\">AWS AppConfig</a>）。</p>\n<p>最后一环是<strong>把&quot;配置变更&quot;与&quot;权益核销&quot;对账打通</strong>。一次门槛改动会让大批用户同时升级并触发现有权益的<a href=\"../benefit-redemption-fulfillment/voucher-issuance-wallet-ledger\">发放与账本写入</a>；若发布不携带&quot;预期影响量&quot;（预计新增多少 Gold、多发多少张券），第一道防线就沦为&quot;看券是不是发爆了&quot;。正确做法是发布前对当前用户快照跑一次<strong>影响预估</strong>（dry-run），把预期量写进发布单，发布后与实际核销量对账，偏差超阈值即回滚。配置治理由此从&quot;防止改错&quot;升级为&quot;改动可预测、可对账、可回滚&quot;，与<a href=\"../benefit-catalog-entitlement/benefit-catalog-taxonomy\">权益目录分级</a>共同构成从参数到履约的闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>等级与权益配置治理的骨架是三件事：把参数<strong>外置成版本化数据</strong>（可回滚、可复现），把发布<strong>做成带校验、审批、灰度的流程</strong>（错误止步于发布而非用户投诉），把改动<strong>做成受控实验</strong>（用序贯检验对抗偷看，用 holdout 对抗合成谬误，用护栏指标守住底线）。三者共用一条原则：任何会同时影响结算、履约、营销、风控四链路的改动，在&quot;保存即生效&quot;的模型下都不可能是安全的。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"等级与权益配置治理：版本、审计与分层实验","id":"等级与权益配置治理-版本-审计与分层实验"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"配置即数据：为什么门槛和权益目录必须外置","id":"配置即数据-为什么门槛和权益目录必须外置"},{"level":2,"text":"版本化与审计：谁能改、改了什么、怎么回滚","id":"版本化与审计-谁能改-改了什么-怎么回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"分层实验：holdout、护栏与分流的两层结构","id":"分层实验-holdout-护栏与分流的两层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"统计推断：为什么不能\"看着看着就停\"","id":"统计推断-为什么不能-看着看着就停"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境合规与运营治理：实验与分层的边界","id":"跨境合规与运营治理-实验与分层的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"权益成本、负债与 ROI 度量：核销率与增量收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/membership-tier-benefits-entitlement-engine/retention-measurement-ops/benefit-cost-roi-measurement"},"next":null}